---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use | VizAI" description="Legal terms for using VizAI services.">
  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="container narrow center">
      <div class="pill">Terms</div>
      <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 12px;">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Legal terms for using VizAI services</p>
      <p class="micro" style="margin-top: 10px;"><em>Last updated: January 2025</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p>By using VizAI services, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use our services.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Services Provided</h2>
      <p>VizAI provides:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>AI visibility assessments and monitoring</li>
        <li>Structured business data creation</li>
        <li>Recommendations for improving AI understanding</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">What We Don't Guarantee</h2>
      <p>VizAI cannot guarantee:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Specific AI model outputs or behavior</li>
        <li>Wikipedia entry approval or retention</li>
        <li>Immediate changes in AI responses</li>
        <li>Results from third-party platforms we don't control</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Client Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>You agree to:</p>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Provide accurate business information</li>
        <li>Notify us of material business changes</li>
        <li>Use our services ethically and legally</li>
        <li>Pay fees on time according to your service tier</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Payment Terms</h2>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Setup fees are due before work begins</li>
        <li>Monthly fees are billed in advance</li>
        <li>Prices are in CAD unless otherwise specified</li>
        <li>Refunds are at VizAI's discretion (see refund policy in FAQ)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Service Minimums</h2>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li><strong>Tier 0:</strong> One-time service, no minimum</li>
        <li><strong>Tier 1:</strong> 3-month minimum commitment</li>
        <li><strong>Tier 2:</strong> 3-6 month minimum commitment</li>
        <li><strong>Tier 3:</strong> 6-month minimum commitment</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Cancellation</h2>
      <p>You may cancel with 30 days written notice to <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io">hello@vizai.io</a> after your minimum term. No refunds for partial months. Setup fees are non-refundable once work begins.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Your business data remains yours</li>
        <li>VizAI's methodology and tools remain ours</li>
        <li>Reports and analysis are licensed to you for your use</li>
        <li>You may not resell VizAI services without an agency agreement</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>VizAI's liability is limited to fees paid in the past 3 months. We're not liable for indirect damages, lost profits, or third-party actions. We provide services "as is" without warranties.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms with 30 days notice to active clients. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance of new terms.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by Canadian law. Disputes will be resolved in Canadian courts.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io">hello@vizai.io</a></p>

      <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding: 24px; background: rgba(123, 92, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(123, 92, 255, 0.15);">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted, #c0c2d8);">
          <strong>Location:</strong> Canada<br>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io" style="color: var(--accent-strong);">hello@vizai.io</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
